# The gwz-sspi commit the transport candidate job checks out beside gwz-core
# (.github/workflows/transport-candidate.yml). gwz-core's Cargo.toml names gwz-sspi
# by path, beside gwz-core, behind gwz_transport_candidate; Cargo reads that
# manifest in every build, so every job that runs cargo on gwz-core has it there. Bump rule: a gwz-core commit whose candidate build needs a newer
# gwz-sspi moves this pin in the same commit, to a gwz-sspi commit already on
# its main. The job reads the first 40-hex line.
